From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: bpereira <bpereira@cloudflare.com>
Date: Wed, 28 Oct 2026 13:09:33 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] Rebuild table cells' grid styles instead of storing them

Every table cell kept a converted taffy::Style (408 bytes on wasm32) for
the whole life of its table, though the grid reads a cell's style only
for placement and alignment. Cells now keep their computed style and
grid placement and rebuild the taffy style with the same conversion on
each read. Captions, whose margins point into the table's adjustments,
keep theirs.

Signed-off-by: bpereira <bpereira@cloudflare.com>
---
 src/layout/table.rs | 190 +++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++-------------
 1 file changed, 133 insertions(+), 57 deletions(-)

diff --git a/src/layout/table.rs b/src/layout/table.rs
index 637d84e..7df5fda 100644
